  "description": "<p class='problem-lead'>判斷字串 <code>a</code> 是否包含子字串 <code>b</code>。</p><p>讀取兩個字串 <code>a</code>、<code>b</code>，判斷 <code>a</code> 之中是否出現過完整的 <code>b</code>（可以在任何位置，不限開頭或結尾）。比對必須區分大小寫。特別規定：當 <code>b</code> 是空字串時，視為必定包含，一律輸出 <code>true</code>。是則輸出小寫 <code>true</code>，否則輸出小寫 <code>false</code>。</p>",
  "hint": "<p>Python 可以用 <code>in</code> 運算子直接判斷一個字串是否包含另一個字串。</p>",
  "inputFormat": "<p>共兩行：第一行是字串 <code>a</code>，第二行是字串 <code>b</code>；<code>b</code> 可能為空行。</p>",
  "outputFormat": "<p>若 <code>a</code> 包含 <code>b</code>，輸出 <code>true</code>；否則輸出 <code>false</code>。</p>",
  "constraints": "<ul><li>0 ≤ a 的字元數 ≤ 100</li><li>0 ≤ b 的字元數 ≤ 100</li></ul>",
  "timeLimit": 1,
  "memoryLimit": 256,
  "sampleInput": "banana\nana",
  "sampleOutput": "true",
  "samples": [
    { "input": "banana\nana", "output": "true" },
    { "input": "apple\npie", "output": "false" },
    { "input": "hello\nhello", "output": "true" }
  ],
  "testCases": [
    { "input": "banana\nana", "output": "true" },
    { "input": "apple\npie", "output": "false" },
    { "input": "hello\nhello", "output": "true" },
    { "input": "banana\nxyz", "output": "false" },
    { "input": "hello\n", "output": "true" },
    { "input": "abc\nabcd", "output": "false" },
    { "input": "Hello\nhello", "output": "false" },
    { "input": "aaaa\naa", "output": "true" },
    { "input": "start\nst", "output": "true" },
    { "input": "end\nnd", "output": "true" }
  ],
